{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenge is back and bigger than ever! <strong>Can You Make It Man \u2013 Reconstructed</strong> has been rebuilt from the ground up with a brand-new look, smoother movement, and trickier obstacles that will push your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, dodge, and climb your way through wild courses filled with surprises \u2014 and yes, the sassy bird is back to keep you on your toes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 What\u2019s New in the Reconstructed Demo?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Makeover</strong> \u2013 a fresh new art style that brings the world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Controls</strong> \u2013 tighter movement, smoother climbing, and improved responsiveness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Obstacles</strong> \u2013 tougher challenges and redesigned levels to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Fixes &amp; Improvements</strong> \u2013 everything polished for a cleaner experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sassy Bird</strong> \u2013 louder, sassier, and ready to roast you when you fail.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025920?t=1758596311","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025920/49112c5262d53fb45932f62b230dce9a2446fbc1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758596311","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025920/d7ac799067f9a3d176408d0ac611a25ce3d4cfe6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758596311","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025920/d7ac799067f9a3d176408d0ac611a25ce3d4cfe6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758596311","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"d